  "details": "1. Navigate to My Avatars.\n\n2. Pick an avatar and click View Avatar Details (important, click the info icon \"View Avatar Details\" for consistent results).\n\n3. Observe the avatar on the right very carefully. It'll be brighter, white-ish for a single frame once \"Details\" finishes loading avatar details (platform compatibility, SDK avatar version, etc) after the loading spinner.\n\n4. I can optionally press the left arrow symboled \"← Back\" button in avatar details to spot the issue again for a single frame.\n\nI took a screenshot from a video recording. Before & after. I can also reproduce this without a video consistently with every avatar, and this issue persists with client restarts.\n\nBoth the Default Public Version (Build 1820) and open-beta branch (Build 1832) are affected.",
